## MCP Connection Model
- Scope: The endpoint is app-scoped to app_wxppx6-6v5Wb on tenant prod; requests are enforced server-side with app and tenant context.
- Primary surface today: `tools`
- Discovery note: Treat tools/list as canonical discovery. Do not assume MCP resources or prompts are available for this app.
