## Bootstrap Semantics
- Planning: dc__plan_architecture persists a contract draft and the selected/current archetype only. It does not seed allowlist entries or data-source bindings.
- Scaffolding: dc__scaffold_app_domain merges archetype defaults into the app contract and seeds missing allowlist entries, data-source bindings, and standards defaults when needed.
- Validation: dc__validate_app_contract checks the persisted contract against current allowlist membership, enabled bindings and scopes, public routes, standards prerequisites, and runtime surfaces.
- Call dc__export_app_contract to inspect the current persisted state.
- If no contract exists yet, run dc__plan_architecture.
- If the planned contract still has unmet allowlist or binding requirements, run dc__scaffold_app_domain with `merge: true`.
- Re-run dc__export_app_contract and then dc__validate_app_contract.

